# The build context is the repository root, but serve/Dockerfile only ever
# copies serve/*.go, serve/go.mod, site/ and web/. Everything listed here is
# kept out
# so that editing it neither slows the context upload nor invalidates a build
# cache layer that does not depend on it.

.git
.github
.claude

node_modules
src-tauri
test
e2e
docs

# Runtime, not source: drafts, event state and the throwaway checkouts.
drafts
state
worktrees
clones
logs

*.md

# Except what the site hands out rather than writes about: the skills, and the
# install document that carries them. Excluded, those links are 404s.
!site/skills/*.md
!site/install.md

# The install document is generated from the files it installs. The generator
# builds the site rather than being part of it, and the collector's own tests
# are not what a reader downloads.
site/install-doc.mjs
site/skills/collector/test
